      "value": "<p>Installed in an ACPA, this takes a Cyberware option slot instead of an armor upgrade slot.</p><p>Acts as an internal agent. Gives a +2 to Concentration checks.</p><p>Removes DEX and REF penalties from armor when making attack rolls. Can target one person or piece of cover using voice commands, giving +1 to attack rolls against the target until the end of your turn. Can only swap targets once per round.</p><p>Shuts down upon Head SP reaching 0.</p>"
